1
00:00:01,200 --> 00:00:03,600
Among China's eight main cuisines

2
00:00:03,920 --> 00:00:05,720
it's Sichuan fare that's the most popular

3
00:00:04,280 --> 00:00:06,160
(Sichuan Cuisine)

4
00:00:05,840 --> 00:00:07,000
widely served

5
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:09,480
and evocative of local culture

6
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:14,120
It is because the bulk of Sichuan's toothsome dishes

7
00:00:14,120 --> 00:00:14,960
originate in local households

8
00:00:14,480 --> 00:00:15,000
(Folk Gastronomy)

9
00:00:15,080 --> 00:00:15,560
It's home cooking

10
00:00:15,160 --> 00:00:15,880
(Home Cooking)

11
00:00:16,240 --> 00:00:18,440
It's all around the country

12
00:00:17,240 --> 00:00:18,480
(All around the country)

13
00:00:18,680 --> 00:00:20,960
Among them all, Sichuan-style dishes

14
00:00:20,200 --> 00:00:22,920
(Most Irresistible)

15
00:00:21,480 --> 00:00:22,920
are the most popular

16
00:00:22,080 --> 00:00:22,920
(Most Delectable)

17
00:00:23,360 --> 00:00:26,200
Exotic flavors conjured from

18
00:00:26,440 --> 00:00:30,040
ceaseless spicy experimentation

19
00:00:30,040 --> 00:00:32,080
constitute the very soul of Sichuan cuisine

20
00:00:32,080 --> 00:00:35,560
and its universal appeal

21
00:00:35,560 --> 00:00:38,120
No fish is added to fish-flavored shredded pork

22
00:00:38,360 --> 00:00:40,880
But the dish has a fishy flavor

23
00:00:38,640 --> 00:00:41,280
(No Fish)

24
00:00:41,440 --> 00:00:42,800
I think it contains fish

25
00:00:42,040 --> 00:00:43,040
(Fish)

26
00:00:43,120 --> 00:00:44,200
The flavor is not from fish

27
00:00:43,200 --> 00:00:46,680
(A Matter of Philosophy)

28
00:00:44,360 --> 00:00:46,680
It's a matter of philosophy

29
00:00:45,680 --> 00:00:46,680
(A Matter of Philosophy)

30
00:00:46,800 --> 00:00:50,720
Tasting it is a moment of epicurean wonder

31
00:00:50,040 --> 00:00:50,800
(Delicious)

32
00:00:51,400 --> 00:00:54,240
The series presents Sichuan cuisine's

33
00:00:54,240 --> 00:00:57,800
six most representative and influential dishes

34
00:00:58,120 --> 00:00:59,520
Seemingly ordinary

35
00:00:59,760 --> 00:01:06,000
each one has an intriguing backstory

36
00:01:06,560 --> 00:01:13,080
(Sichuan Cuisine)

37
00:01:13,560 --> 00:01:18,640
(Couple's Sliced Beef in Chili Sauce)

38
00:01:19,480 --> 00:01:22,320
The popular Mapo Tofu was introduced to the world

39
00:01:22,320 --> 00:01:24,600
by a housewife

40
00:01:25,600 --> 00:01:28,080
Another dish known as the Couple's Sliced Beef in Chili Sauce

41
00:01:28,080 --> 00:01:30,480
is credited to a poor couple

42
00:01:32,360 --> 00:01:33,560
Most famous Sichuan dishes

43
00:01:33,560 --> 00:01:39,640
derive from local home cooking

44
00:01:40,080 --> 00:01:41,800
In Sichuan

45
00:01:41,800 --> 00:01:44,240
many cooks

46
00:01:44,240 --> 00:01:46,160
still explore new recipes

47
00:01:46,160 --> 00:01:48,720
out of their love of food

48
00:01:50,120 --> 00:01:52,280
Zhang Peng built a garden on his roof

49
00:01:52,280 --> 00:01:53,920
where he grows vegetables

50
00:01:53,920 --> 00:01:56,440
and also makes sausages

51
00:01:56,440 --> 00:01:58,240
and preserved meat

52
00:02:00,400 --> 00:02:02,560
Though he has made a name for himself on social media

53
00:02:02,560 --> 00:02:03,480
as a connoisseur

54
00:02:03,480 --> 00:02:05,840
he is first of all a developer of food

55
00:02:06,280 --> 00:02:07,240
This garden

56
00:02:07,240 --> 00:02:09,480
not only provides for his home cooking

57
00:02:09,480 --> 00:02:11,360
and boutique catering

58
00:02:11,360 --> 00:02:13,120
but also serves as

59
00:02:13,120 --> 00:02:15,320
a food laboratory

60
00:02:23,120 --> 00:02:24,520
On weekends

61
00:02:24,520 --> 00:02:25,760
Zhang Peng's friends often

62
00:02:25,760 --> 00:02:27,520
get together at his place

63
00:02:27,520 --> 00:02:29,320
He loves to try his newly created dishes

64
00:02:30,240 --> 00:02:31,160
One is

65
00:02:31,160 --> 00:02:32,520
his version of

66
00:02:32,520 --> 00:02:34,200
the couple's sliced beef in chili sauce

67
00:02:34,600 --> 00:02:37,080
Preparation is required

68
00:02:43,520 --> 00:02:45,400
This particular dish

69
00:02:45,400 --> 00:02:46,320
is popular

70
00:02:46,840 --> 00:02:47,960
and well-known

71
00:02:47,960 --> 00:02:49,400
But it is by no means

72
00:02:49,400 --> 00:02:51,120
common at family dinners

73
00:02:51,440 --> 00:02:52,600
The reason is easy to explain

74
00:02:52,800 --> 00:02:53,720
The ingredients

75
00:02:53,960 --> 00:02:55,120
are not readily available

76
00:02:55,520 --> 00:02:57,080
and the process

77
00:02:57,080 --> 00:02:58,120
is complicated

78
00:03:00,320 --> 00:03:02,360
It requires

79
00:03:02,360 --> 00:03:04,480
beef scalp, tripe

80
00:03:04,480 --> 00:03:07,240
tongue and heart

81
00:03:07,680 --> 00:03:09,680
as well as sliced beef

82
00:03:09,680 --> 00:03:10,880
Also, the innards

83
00:03:10,880 --> 00:03:12,480
and various spices

84
00:03:12,480 --> 00:03:14,240
require elaborate preparation

85
00:03:15,960 --> 00:03:18,400
Seemingly simple

86
00:03:18,400 --> 00:03:20,760
this dish is rather complicated indeed

87
00:03:21,480 --> 00:03:24,360
Nowadays in Chengdu

88
00:03:24,360 --> 00:03:28,840
you can find the dish in street markets and supermarkets

89
00:03:27,320 --> 00:03:31,680
(Yuan Tingdong
Chengdu Folklore Scholar)

90
00:03:29,120 --> 00:03:31,160
But simply mixing the ingredients and various spices together

91
00:03:31,680 --> 00:03:32,520
won't produce the authentic taste

92
00:03:32,800 --> 00:03:33,560
The original dish

93
00:03:33,560 --> 00:03:34,960
has a secret condiment

94
00:03:34,960 --> 00:03:36,200
locally called white sauce

95
00:03:39,360 --> 00:03:42,840
(White Sauce)

96
00:03:50,280 --> 00:03:51,960
The beef and innards are boiled in the white sauce first

97
00:03:51,960 --> 00:03:53,560
After being cooled

98
00:04:07,640 --> 00:04:11,960
they are sliced into thin pieces

99
00:04:15,760 --> 00:04:21,600
Home-grown yellow celery is a good match for this dish

100
00:04:22,800 --> 00:04:25,080
And tender ones are better

101
00:04:25,360 --> 00:04:27,840
They are cut into small bits and laid on a plate

102
00:04:28,080 --> 00:04:30,920
White celery or common celery won't do

103
00:04:30,920 --> 00:04:32,640
They will spoil the flavor

104
00:04:33,320 --> 00:04:37,160
(Zhang Peng
Folk Gourmet)

105
00:04:33,400 --> 00:04:36,920
The key is to extract the aroma of the yellow celery

106
00:04:37,520 --> 00:04:41,360
Without it, the dish will lose its flavor

107
00:04:43,760 --> 00:04:46,360
Zhang Peng places the slices on the celery

108
00:04:47,400 --> 00:04:49,240
pours the sauce over it

109
00:04:53,640 --> 00:04:56,760
adds some soy sauce, MSG, sugar

110
00:04:56,760 --> 00:04:59,600
salt and pepper, and mixes them together

111
00:05:03,000 --> 00:05:05,200
The sauce should be added lavishly

112
00:05:05,200 --> 00:05:08,000
It's the major flavor booster

113
00:05:08,000 --> 00:05:13,880
It's made from the white sauce in which the ingredients are boiled

114
00:05:14,480 --> 00:05:15,880
The sauce is the base

115
00:05:15,880 --> 00:05:24,960
Without it, the dish will be dry and tasteless

116
00:05:24,960 --> 00:05:26,600
It is indispensable

117
00:05:26,600 --> 00:05:29,240
for making an excellent dish of couple's sliced beef in chili sauce

118
00:05:37,360 --> 00:05:39,360
Finally, the chef adds chili oil

119
00:05:44,000 --> 00:05:45,560
sprinkles some peanuts on it

120
00:05:48,520 --> 00:05:52,880
(Couple's Sliced Beef in Chili Sauce)

121
00:05:49,240 --> 00:05:52,080
and an exquisite dish with fine color and flavor

122
00:05:52,080 --> 00:05:53,280
is done

123
00:05:57,000 --> 00:05:59,120
Dinner is ready

124
00:05:59,120 --> 00:06:00,360
Let's get started

125
00:06:08,160 --> 00:06:09,782
"fu qi fei pian", the Chinese name of this dish

126
00:06:09,783 --> 00:06:11,000
literally means husband and wife lung slices

127
00:06:11,000 --> 00:06:12,720
But its ingredients do not include lungs

128
00:06:13,000 --> 00:06:18,800
So why does it have this name?

129
00:06:20,560 --> 00:06:25,440
(Chengdu, Sichuan Province)

130
00:06:21,160 --> 00:06:22,800
More than 100 years ago

131
00:06:22,800 --> 00:06:24,800
an area called Huang Cheng Ba in Chengdu

132
00:06:24,800 --> 00:06:27,360
present-day Tianfu Square

133
00:06:27,360 --> 00:06:29,360
was inhabited

134
00:06:29,360 --> 00:06:31,320
by a Muslim community

135
00:06:32,680 --> 00:06:34,280
In accordance with their religious customs

136
00:06:34,280 --> 00:06:37,120
residents there mainly consume beef and lamb

137
00:06:37,120 --> 00:06:38,720
Beef was their favorite

138
00:06:39,320 --> 00:06:43,000
And the offal was discarded

139
00:06:43,600 --> 00:06:45,280
Some local vendors

140
00:06:45,280 --> 00:06:48,160
collected the leftovers

141
00:06:48,160 --> 00:06:54,920
and invented a delicacy seasoned with chili oil and pepper

142
00:06:55,400 --> 00:06:57,600
They sold this dish

143
00:06:57,600 --> 00:07:00,000
by Sanqiao Bridge in Huang Cheng Ba

144
00:06:59,760 --> 00:07:05,760
(Li Jieren (1891-1962)
Writer)

145
00:07:00,440 --> 00:07:05,520
which is vividly described by a Sichuan writer Li Jieren

146
00:07:06,200 --> 00:07:14,640
In his article written in August 1948, he mentioned that

147
00:07:08,280 --> 00:07:13,320
(Chinese People's Clothing, Food, Housing and Transportation)

148
00:07:15,520 --> 00:07:17,680
(After the beef scalp is cooked)

149
00:07:17,680 --> 00:07:20,400
(it is cut into thin pieces which should be almost transparent)

150
00:07:20,400 --> 00:07:24,240
(Then the sauce, pepper and spicy red oil are added and mixed well)

151
00:07:24,240 --> 00:07:26,040
(The dish is brilliant red in color)

152
00:07:26,040 --> 00:07:28,560
(and smooth, crunchy, spicy, and fragrant in taste)

153
00:07:28,560 --> 00:07:35,720
(The inventor of this dish and the time of its creation remain unknown)

154
00:07:36,000 --> 00:07:38,120
(It was only sold by Sanqiao Bridge in Chengdu)

155
00:07:38,120 --> 00:07:40,320
(The vendor sat on one end of a short bench)

156
00:07:40,320 --> 00:07:42,600
(with a clay pot placed on the other)

157
00:07:42,600 --> 00:07:46,240
(The pot had a fence made of bamboo chopsticks)

158
00:07:46,880 --> 00:07:54,720
(The sliced beef scalp and cheek were piled up in the pot)

159
00:07:54,720 --> 00:07:57,200
(The spicy aroma attracted many passers-by)

160
00:07:58,160 --> 00:07:59,480
Since this dish was cheap

161
00:07:59,480 --> 00:08:00,440
buyers were mostly

162
00:08:00,440 --> 00:08:02,720
from the lower class

163
00:08:03,280 --> 00:08:04,240
But eventually

164
00:08:04,240 --> 00:08:06,000
even noble people

165
00:08:06,000 --> 00:08:07,840
couldn't resist the tempting fragrance

166
00:08:07,840 --> 00:08:10,640
And they would look around as they pass the stand

167
00:08:10,880 --> 00:08:12,240
If there was no acquaintance in sight

168
00:08:12,240 --> 00:08:14,160
they will buy a small portion

169
00:08:14,160 --> 00:08:15,600
quickly eat it

170
00:08:16,080 --> 00:08:17,960
and be on their way

171
00:08:18,400 --> 00:08:20,160
Therefore, this dish was also

172
00:08:20,160 --> 00:08:22,160
referred to as "look around"

173
00:08:24,920 --> 00:08:26,880
It was charged by the number of pieces

174
00:08:27,160 --> 00:08:28,240
The dish's ingredients were cheap

175
00:08:28,240 --> 00:08:29,440
so the price was low

176
00:08:29,440 --> 00:08:31,480
and was popular among common citizens

177
00:08:32,080 --> 00:08:34,400
It was often sold in clay pots

178
00:08:34,680 --> 00:08:37,320
and was also called "potted beef"

179
00:08:38,080 --> 00:08:42,160
(Yuan Tingdong
Chengdu Folklore Scholar)

180
00:08:38,240 --> 00:08:44,320
The vendor prepared a large pot of the sliced beef

181
00:08:44,320 --> 00:08:45,840
He'd stick a few chopsticks in the pot

182
00:08:45,840 --> 00:08:47,000
and place the container on the roadside

183
00:08:47,000 --> 00:08:49,720
Passers-by could grab a few pieces of beef with the chopsticks

184
00:08:49,720 --> 00:08:51,760
choosing the biggest ones, the thickest ones

185
00:08:51,760 --> 00:08:53,480
or the ones with the most sauce

186
00:08:53,480 --> 00:08:54,400
They'd eat them and go on their way

187
00:08:55,440 --> 00:08:57,440
Potted beef

188
00:08:57,880 --> 00:08:58,840
is the most popular dish

189
00:08:58,840 --> 00:08:59,760
enjoyed among common people

190
00:09:01,600 --> 00:09:03,720
More than 100 years later

191
00:09:04,280 --> 00:09:06,840
potted beef has changed from a product made from waste

192
00:09:06,840 --> 00:09:09,360
to a unique food

193
00:09:09,720 --> 00:09:11,800
Instead of being forgotten

194
00:09:12,240 --> 00:09:15,200
it's being constantly developed nowadays

195
00:09:18,840 --> 00:09:21,600
65 kilometers southwest of Chengdu

196
00:09:21,120 --> 00:09:25,960
(Qionglai, Sichuan Province)

197
00:09:21,600 --> 00:09:22,520
is Qionglai

198
00:09:23,120 --> 00:09:25,760
There's a famous food called

199
00:09:26,040 --> 00:09:27,080
milk noodles

200
00:09:28,880 --> 00:09:34,080
(Chen Yuming
Inheritor of Milk Noodles)

201
00:09:28,920 --> 00:09:33,720
The soup of the noodles is white with a yellow tinge

202
00:09:33,720 --> 00:09:34,720
which looks like milk

203
00:09:35,200 --> 00:09:39,160
So people called them "milk noodles"

204
00:09:39,160 --> 00:09:46,520
In order to make authentic milk noodles

205
00:09:46,720 --> 00:09:49,120
preparation should get started one day before

206
00:09:49,760 --> 00:09:54,760
The key to the noodles is the soup

207
00:09:55,240 --> 00:09:56,720
Boil pork bones

208
00:09:56,720 --> 00:09:58,800
after washing them

209
00:09:59,520 --> 00:10:01,200
and wait till the blood seeps out

210
00:10:01,200 --> 00:10:03,920
When the water froths, the bones are taken out

211
00:10:04,720 --> 00:10:06,600
cleaned and broken in the middle

212
00:10:06,840 --> 00:10:08,840
They are then put in the cold water

213
00:10:08,840 --> 00:10:11,040
and seasoned with ginger

214
00:10:11,280 --> 00:10:12,720
pepper and salt

215
00:10:13,040 --> 00:10:14,560
When the soup boils

216
00:10:14,560 --> 00:10:16,040
the fire is turned down

217
00:10:16,480 --> 00:10:18,480
and it is simmered until the meat comes off the bones

218
00:10:18,480 --> 00:10:24,200
When the soup turns white, it's done

219
00:10:24,680 --> 00:10:28,320
This generally takes overnight

220
00:10:33,000 --> 00:10:39,680
The soup is made from pork backbones which are boiled for a long time

221
00:10:39,840 --> 00:10:46,040
It takes over 10 hours each day to make this soup

222
00:10:48,240 --> 00:10:49,000
Early in the morning

223
00:10:49,000 --> 00:10:54,400
customers come to the noodle shop

224
00:10:54,840 --> 00:10:57,080
The soup is freshly prepared

225
00:10:57,400 --> 00:11:00,240
which is the best time to enjoy it

226
00:11:00,240 --> 00:11:03,720
The cook pours the soup into a large bowl

227
00:11:04,040 --> 00:11:11,120
The freshly made noodles are thin, smooth, and tender

228
00:11:11,840 --> 00:11:14,520
Different sauces and condiments

229
00:11:14,800 --> 00:11:18,280
are added according to the customer's order

230
00:11:18,760 --> 00:11:22,440
The fragrant noodles, the mellow soup, and the tasty sauce

231
00:11:22,440 --> 00:11:24,600
are mouth-watering

232
00:11:25,880 --> 00:11:28,200
However, at this point

233
00:11:28,200 --> 00:11:31,040
the breakfast is still incomplete

234
00:11:31,560 --> 00:11:36,720
The other star on the breakfast table is bobo chicken

235
00:11:37,480 --> 00:11:39,320
To the people of Qionglai

236
00:11:39,320 --> 00:11:41,240
a meal that doesn't include hot and spicy food

237
00:11:41,640 --> 00:11:43,560
is not satisfying

238
00:11:43,840 --> 00:11:46,280
So they eat bobo chicken

239
00:11:46,560 --> 00:11:52,040
made with chili pepper and other spices with their milk noodles

240
00:11:52,480 --> 00:11:58,960
The tasty noodles and hot appetizing chicken suit their taste

241
00:12:02,000 --> 00:12:07,200
(Chen Yuming
Inheritor of Milk Noodles)

242
00:12:02,200 --> 00:12:04,880
When I was young, I was told that

243
00:12:04,880 --> 00:12:10,080
bobo chicken was contained in an earthen jar

244
00:12:10,080 --> 00:12:21,680
in which the chicken slices were laid on an upside-down bowl

245
00:12:21,680 --> 00:12:28,120
Bobo means "earthen jar" in Chinese, and that is how the dish got its name

246
00:12:28,120 --> 00:12:33,640
It used to be sold by peddlers who carried it on a long pole

247
00:12:33,640 --> 00:12:36,040
We didn't have much money, so we seldom bought it

248
00:12:36,040 --> 00:12:37,480
It cost 2 cents a slice

249
00:12:41,560 --> 00:12:46,320
The origin of Qionglai bobo chicken is similar to

250
00:12:46,320 --> 00:12:49,600
that of potted beef from Huang Cheng Ba, Chengdu

251
00:12:50,000 --> 00:12:52,680
As living standards improved

252
00:12:52,680 --> 00:12:54,160
the ingredients in the pot

253
00:12:54,160 --> 00:12:55,640
kept changing

254
00:12:56,400 --> 00:12:58,960
Nowadays, offal has been replaced by chicken

255
00:12:59,400 --> 00:13:01,360
But local people, especially the elders

256
00:13:01,360 --> 00:13:04,720
still call it by the old name

257
00:13:05,360 --> 00:13:06,000
Also

258
00:13:06,000 --> 00:13:09,080
bobo chicken is still sold by the piece

259
00:13:13,760 --> 00:13:14,920
By afternoon

260
00:13:14,920 --> 00:13:17,160
the shop has sold almost all its food

261
00:13:17,520 --> 00:13:18,520
The noodle shop is closed

262
00:13:18,960 --> 00:13:22,080
The staff begins preparing for the next day's bobo chicken

263
00:13:22,520 --> 00:13:26,680
The cooks will simmer the soup in the evening

264
00:13:28,760 --> 00:13:32,200
Day in and day out

265
00:13:32,560 --> 00:13:35,240
these hardworking folks prepare food

266
00:13:35,240 --> 00:13:38,040
to sustain the daily lives of the town's people

267
00:13:46,440 --> 00:13:49,040
However the ingredients have changed in the pot

268
00:13:49,320 --> 00:13:53,160
the dish has retained its form and taste

269
00:13:53,640 --> 00:13:56,040
It's always spicy and delicious, inexpensive and good quality

270
00:13:56,360 --> 00:13:58,040
The most famous type

271
00:13:58,040 --> 00:14:04,040
is the couple's sliced beef in chili sauce

272
00:14:05,600 --> 00:14:07,320
There's a story behind the origin of this dish

273
00:14:07,320 --> 00:14:09,320
related to a couple

274
00:14:13,320 --> 00:14:16,160
It's said that in the early 1930s

275
00:14:16,560 --> 00:14:19,080
Guo Chaohua, a native of Zhongjiang County, Sichuan

276
00:14:19,080 --> 00:14:25,240
joined the army and became a cook

277
00:14:25,280 --> 00:14:31,920
(Wang Chujun
Son-in-law of Guo Chaohua)

278
00:14:26,120 --> 00:14:34,120
I learned the story from my parents-in-law when they were both alive

279
00:14:34,600 --> 00:14:40,720
My wife's father said he was an army cook

280
00:14:40,960 --> 00:14:45,160
One day, during a march, he fell into a snowdrift and blacked out

281
00:14:45,160 --> 00:14:47,560
Some local passers-by found him and saved him

282
00:14:48,200 --> 00:14:50,800
Then he went back to Chengdu

283
00:14:52,160 --> 00:14:59,880
and married a girl from Anyue named Zhang Tianzheng

284
00:15:00,880 --> 00:15:06,040
Guo Chaohua and Zhang Tianzheng were an ordinary couple

285
00:15:06,400 --> 00:15:10,200
Yet they managed to invent a well-known dish in Sichuan cuisine

286
00:15:10,520 --> 00:15:13,920
This feat was related to their living conditions at that time

287
00:15:14,640 --> 00:15:16,880
The newly married couple had no means of earning a living

288
00:15:16,880 --> 00:15:18,960
When they saw the leftovers of a slaughterhouse

289
00:15:19,240 --> 00:15:26,720
they collected them to make a dish, and then for sale

290
00:15:29,320 --> 00:15:31,440
Starting in 1936

291
00:15:31,680 --> 00:15:33,880
residents in Huang Cheng Ba

292
00:15:33,880 --> 00:15:40,200
would often see a couple with a basket

293
00:15:40,200 --> 00:15:45,520
peddling their food in every season and in all weather

294
00:15:43,400 --> 00:15:49,000
(Depiction of Culinary Customs in Old Chengdu)

295
00:15:45,520 --> 00:15:48,200
They were Guo Chaohua and Zhang Tianzheng

296
00:15:49,200 --> 00:15:53,920
Taking notice of discarded beef hearts, tongues, and scalps

297
00:15:53,920 --> 00:15:54,840
outside the meat shops

298
00:15:55,360 --> 00:16:00,720
and inspired by the potted beef sold at Sanqiao Bridge

299
00:16:01,240 --> 00:16:07,760
they had the idea to make a new dish with this offal

300
00:16:11,360 --> 00:16:18,880
The couple experimented with the braising and seasoning process

301
00:16:19,280 --> 00:16:24,360
They gradually developed a dish that was unique, tasty, and cheap

302
00:16:24,360 --> 00:16:25,760
And it became popular

303
00:16:26,600 --> 00:16:31,520
Because it was made from discarded beef offal and leftovers

304
00:16:31,880 --> 00:16:33,320
consumers often refer to the dish as "fei" slices

305
00:16:33,320 --> 00:16:37,160
meaning discarded slices

306
00:16:42,120 --> 00:16:47,360
(Yuan Tingdong
Chengdu Folklore Scholar)

307
00:16:42,600 --> 00:16:45,040
"Husband and wife lung slices" is the literal translation of the name

308
00:16:45,040 --> 00:16:47,160
but actually it is not made of the lung of a cow

309
00:16:47,680 --> 00:16:55,400
rather the leftovers, such as the scalp, liver, and stomach

310
00:16:55,400 --> 00:16:59,040
The word "lung" is a homonym of "discarded" in Chinese

311
00:16:59,680 --> 00:17:03,800
The couple's major customers were students and laborers

312
00:17:04,800 --> 00:17:11,880
With 1 cent, they could have 2 to 3 pieces

313
00:17:12,280 --> 00:17:16,760
The dish was tasty, and their customers liked the young couple

314
00:17:17,600 --> 00:17:18,760
Some youngsters played a joke on them

315
00:17:18,760 --> 00:17:20,480
by sticking a note on Guo Chaohua's back

316
00:17:21,320 --> 00:17:26,960
which read "couple's discarded slices"

317
00:17:27,880 --> 00:17:39,200
Later a local scholar changed the word "discarded" into its homonym "lung"

318
00:17:39,200 --> 00:17:42,720
because the former had a negative connotation

319
00:17:45,320 --> 00:17:50,880
In fact, it contains no lung pieces

320
00:17:54,200 --> 00:17:58,800
This is how the word "discarded" was replaced with "lung"

321
00:17:59,480 --> 00:18:01,800
The renaming of the dish

322
00:18:02,000 --> 00:18:05,640
opened a new era for the couple

323
00:18:06,040 --> 00:18:08,960
and their life greatly changed

324
00:18:12,280 --> 00:18:14,800
In 1949, Chengdu was liberated

325
00:18:15,120 --> 00:18:22,480
and the couple found a place to set up shop and sell their dish

326
00:18:23,320 --> 00:18:24,840
In 1956, the Chengdu Catering Company

327
00:18:25,760 --> 00:18:37,360
purchased all the famous local private food businesses, including theirs

328
00:18:37,360 --> 00:18:42,480
The couple were both employed by the company

329
00:18:42,480 --> 00:18:44,520
They continued to work there till they retired

330
00:18:45,920 --> 00:18:54,720
In 1956, the couple's shop was purchased

331
00:18:54,720 --> 00:18:58,080
and was nationalized in 1958

332
00:18:58,680 --> 00:19:04,600
They were transformed from vendors to workers at a state-owned company

333
00:19:04,600 --> 00:19:06,400
taking charge of the cooking procedure

334
00:19:13,680 --> 00:19:17,960
The Chengdu Couple's Sliced Beef Shop

335
00:19:18,360 --> 00:19:22,000
has inherited the traditional method of making this dish

336
00:19:22,360 --> 00:19:24,440
and continues to modify and improve it

337
00:19:25,240 --> 00:19:28,120
Wang Qinrui, the chief executive cook of the shop

338
00:19:28,120 --> 00:19:33,040
is the current inheritor of the dish

339
00:19:33,640 --> 00:19:38,960
(Wang Qinrui, Inheritor
Couple's Sliced Beef in Chili Sauce)

340
00:19:33,880 --> 00:19:35,760
I'm the third-generation inheritor

341
00:19:36,840 --> 00:19:40,480
My master learned directly

342
00:19:40,480 --> 00:19:44,240
from Guo Chaohua and Zhang Tianzheng, the founders

343
00:19:45,200 --> 00:19:49,800
Now the ingredients and condiments for the dish are fixed

344
00:19:49,800 --> 00:19:52,400
which include beef scalp, heart

345
00:19:52,400 --> 00:19:55,400
tongue, stomach, and beef itself

346
00:19:55,400 --> 00:19:58,120
No lungs or other things are included

347
00:19:58,760 --> 00:20:03,000
They are cleaned and boiled with over 20 spices

348
00:20:03,520 --> 00:20:07,600
The formula is kept highly confidential

349
00:20:17,640 --> 00:20:22,080
The staff's slicing skills are impressive

350
00:20:33,200 --> 00:20:38,400
When they are cut, the slices should be as wide as a cow's hoof

351
00:20:38,400 --> 00:20:40,720
and as thin as a cicada's wing

352
00:20:40,720 --> 00:20:46,880
If you lay a slice on a book, you can clearly see the words on the page

353
00:20:47,280 --> 00:20:50,880
The thinner it is, the stronger the flavor and the better the taste

354
00:20:52,880 --> 00:20:54,440
The dish is cooked with various condiments

355
00:20:54,440 --> 00:20:56,520
as well as small bits of celery and peanuts

356
00:20:57,000 --> 00:20:59,160
along with the original sauce and soup

357
00:20:59,520 --> 00:21:03,480
There are no chemical flavor boosters

358
00:21:03,840 --> 00:21:10,800
Its supreme taste relies on the magical combination

359
00:21:10,800 --> 00:21:13,480
of different spices, chili oil, and pepper powder

360
00:21:14,160 --> 00:21:17,080
It's the love of husband and wife

361
00:21:17,360 --> 00:21:20,800
that gave birth to this renowned dish

362
00:21:29,680 --> 00:21:32,520
Zhang Tianzheng retired at the age of 55

363
00:21:32,960 --> 00:21:36,720
and later she was reemployed to become a technical advisor

364
00:21:37,080 --> 00:21:42,840
She kept that position until 1991 when she was 71 years old

365
00:21:45,040 --> 00:21:52,120
In 1994, in Chengdu, a shop named Guo Couple's Discarded Slices

366
00:21:52,120 --> 00:21:53,040
had its grand opening

367
00:21:53,440 --> 00:21:54,760
This puzzled residents

368
00:21:54,760 --> 00:21:56,920
who have long been accustomed to the name

369
00:21:56,920 --> 00:21:58,040
"lung slices"

370
00:21:58,640 --> 00:22:02,320
The owner of this store is Guo Ruiqiu

371
00:22:02,320 --> 00:22:06,000
the eldest daughter of Guo Chaohua and Zhang Tianzheng

372
00:22:06,400 --> 00:22:08,120
She chose the word "discarded"

373
00:22:08,440 --> 00:22:10,360
to pay tribute to the old brand name

374
00:22:10,360 --> 00:22:12,160
when her parents first created this dish

375
00:22:16,000 --> 00:22:18,080
When she was a teenager

376
00:22:18,080 --> 00:22:22,480
her parents taught her how to cook the dish

377
00:22:23,000 --> 00:22:24,920
including selecting ingredients, slicing them

378
00:22:24,920 --> 00:22:27,320
boiling the soup, making red chili oil

379
00:22:27,320 --> 00:22:29,560
and the secret proportions of different condiments

380
00:22:29,560 --> 00:22:37,280
She thus mastered the most authentic recipe for this dish

381
00:22:53,680 --> 00:22:56,440
In 1994, Guo Chaohua passed away

382
00:22:56,880 --> 00:22:59,760
In 2002, Zhang Tianzheng passed away

383
00:23:00,480 --> 00:23:04,640
The creators of this legendary dish

384
00:23:04,640 --> 00:23:07,880
finished their journey in the world of food

385
00:23:08,400 --> 00:23:12,680
leaving behind a peerless delicacy

386
00:23:13,440 --> 00:23:15,880
Chengdu media honored Zhang Tianzheng

387
00:23:15,880 --> 00:23:19,680
as the longest-lived among all the founders of classic food brands

388
00:23:20,480 --> 00:23:26,520
Her death marked the end of a legendary era of folk food

389
00:23:30,680 --> 00:23:33,120
Food is born out of love

390
00:23:33,120 --> 00:23:35,400
And the creation process of the couple's sliced beef in chili sauce

391
00:23:35,400 --> 00:23:41,040
stands as solid proof of this

392
00:23:41,800 --> 00:23:45,600
One article about it says

393
00:23:46,040 --> 00:23:47,640
"The dish is not made of lungs

394
00:23:48,320 --> 00:23:49,640
but its taste is multi-layered

395
00:23:50,240 --> 00:23:52,600
hot, spicy, fresh, and fragrant."

396
00:23:53,480 --> 00:24:00,880
The name of the dish is also auspicious for marital harmony and happy life

